---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Richiesta ricevuta — Grazie"
  description="La tua richiesta è stata ricevuta. Marco Regalia ti risponderà entro un giorno lavorativo."
>
  <section class="thanks-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="thanks-content">
        <div class="thanks-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
            <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="section-num">— Richiesta ricevuta</span>
        <h1>Grazie, <span class="accent">a presto.</span></h1>
        <p class="thanks-lede">
          Ho ricevuto la tua richiesta. Ti rispondo entro un giorno lavorativo
          all'indirizzo email che mi hai indicato.
        </p>

        <div class="thanks-info">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Cosa succede ora</span>
            <span class="info-val">Leggo la tua richiesta personalmente</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Quando ti rispondo</span>
            <span class="info-val">Entro un giorno lavorativo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Se è urgente</span>
            <span class="info-val">
              <a href="tel:+393475400385">+39 347 540 0385</a>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="thanks-actions">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Torna alla homepage</a>
          <a href="/casi-studio/" class="btn-link">
            Leggi i casi studio nel frattempo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .thanks-page {
    padding-top: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .thanks-content {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .thanks-icon {
    color: var(--blue);
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background: var(--blue-bg);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--blue-border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .thanks-content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.5vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .thanks-lede {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.5vw, 17px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .thanks-info {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .info-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .info-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .info-val {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .info-val a {
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .thanks-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .info-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
